### ===================================================================
### TERRA WATCH - API TEST SUITE (Compatible with httpyac & REST Client)
### ===================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@mlUrl = http://localhost:8000

### 1. Backend Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Check Live Weather & Risk for Old Manali (32.259°N, 77.175°E)
### Notice the "weather" object returning real-time temperature & wind!
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/risk/manali-01

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Check Live Weather & Risk for Gulmarg Apharwat Ridge
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/risk/gulmarg-02

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Check Live Weather & Risk for Kedarnath Shrine Basin
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/risk/kedarnath-03

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Check Live Weather & Risk for Dras (Coldest Inhabited Sector)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/risk/dras-04

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. Get All 8 Monitored Villages (Map Pins & Comparative Matrix)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/villages

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. PREDICT ANY ARBITRARY GPS COORDINATE ON EARTH
### Pulls live weather for that exact point and predicts avalanche risk!
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/predict-coordinate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lat": 34.37,
  "lng": 80.24,
  "slope_angle": 38
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. Interactive What-If Scenario Sandbox Simulation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "snow_depth": 55,
  "slope_angle": 38,
  "wind_speed": 32,
  "temperature": -7.5,
  "rainfall": 0
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. Get High-Risk Emergency Alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 10. Generate Official SDRF / NDRF Evacuation Dispatch Advisory
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dispatch/gulmarg-02

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 11. Direct Satellite Check: Open-Meteo Weather API (Raw Feed)
### Compare this directly against what {{baseUrl}}/api/risk/manali-01 returns!
GET https://api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast?latitude=32.2590&longitude=77.1750&current=temperature_2m,relative_humidity_2m,wind_speed_10m,snowfall,rain&timezone=auto

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 12. Direct ML Service Health Check (FastAPI)
GET {{mlUrl}}/health

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 13. Direct ML Prediction Endpoint (FastAPI + XGBoost)
POST {{mlUrl}}/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "snow_depth": 45,
  "slope_angle": 38,
  "wind_speed": 22,
  "temperature": -4,
  "rainfall": 0
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 14. Backend Open-Meteo Proxy & Cache Test for Any GPS Coordinates
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/weather?lat=32.2432&lng=77.1892

